And it took me a little while to get used to it.

00:23:31.920 --> 00:23:33.960
Once I got used to it, like, okay, I was used to it.

00:23:33.960 --> 00:23:37.240
But when you do stop and think about it, like, well, this doesn't, I don't know, I don't

00:23:37.240 --> 00:23:41.160
know a better solution, but this doesn't really translate to what it's like, you know, to,

00:23:41.160 --> 00:23:42.820
to turn the wheel of a car.

