00:25:45.980 --> 00:25:51.000
And so we've talked a lot about the Grand Prix mode already with the first you see a map

00:25:51.000 --> 00:25:55.260
of the course, then you're brought into the qualifying sessions and see the already posted

00:25:55.260 --> 00:25:56.360
qualifying times.

